@startuml
title Vina Bim Shop Section 01 Lambda Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 180

actor "Executive Teams\n1-hour freshness" as Executive
actor "BI/Livestreaming Teams\nreal-time visibility" as BI

rectangle "Source Systems" as Sources {
  component "Periodic table-state exports\ncustomers, sellers, products,\norders, payments, shipments" as Offline
  component "JSON event producer\nbusiness event envelopes" as Producer
}

queue "Kafka\ncommerce_events\ncatalog_events\nfulfillment_events\nops_events" as Kafka

rectangle "Lambda Processing Paths" as Lambda {
  component "Spark Batch Path\nhourly validation, dedup,\nschema evolution handling,\nbatch aggregates" as Spark
  component "Flink Streaming Path\nevent-time watermarks,\nallowed lateness,\nreal-time revenue/issues/anomalies" as Flink
}

database "MinIO Medallion Lakehouse\nBronze batch: Parquet snapshots\nBronze event: JSONL replay logs\nSilver/Gold: curated tables" as MinIO
database "Hive Metastore\ncatalog only" as Hive
component "Trino SQL Serving\nqueries curated lakehouse tables" as Trino
component "Realtime serving sink\nmetrics / alerts / dashboard" as Realtime

Offline --> MinIO : Parquet snapshots: checkpointed table state
Producer --> Kafka : JSON envelope events
Kafka --> Flink : direct real-time consumption
Kafka --> MinIO : JSONL event log: replayable business events
MinIO --> Spark : hourly batch reads landed Bronze data
Spark --> MinIO : curated Silver/Gold tables
Flink --> Realtime : live metrics / alerts / dashboard
Realtime --> BI : live operations
Flink --> MinIO : curated streaming tables
MinIO --> Hive : table registration for curated lakehouse tables
Hive --> Trino : catalog metadata
Trino --> Executive : hourly KPI dashboards
Trino --> BI : reconciled historical SQL

note bottom of MinIO
Section 01 owns source simulation, raw contracts, event topics, and evidence.
Section 02 owns runnable Spark/Flink jobs and final Gold schema design.
end note

@enduml
